     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">In case you didn’t see it elsewhere, here’s an announcement for the\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">UC open source contributors &amp;</span> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">maintainers virtual meetup (i.e. writing code in a language like R or python with an open license, or you’re thinking about an open license).  The meetings from this group on our campus have been really welcoming\r\n to new folks, so if you’re a beginner, definitely consider coming.  More details below.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Geospatial Data Scientist<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">DataLab: Data Science &amp; Informatics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">370 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">ORCID:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464428926000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ql7TKhYJE2xhOXnTl1Uav\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">0000-0002-2954-8710</span></a>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> opensource-announce Sympa List (request) &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">opensource-an...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Laura Langdon<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, July 1, 2025 3:00 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> opensource-announce Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">opensourc...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [opensource-announce] ICYMI: join us for a virtual OSS meetup!<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Join us on <b>July 10th at noon</b> for the inaugural UC open source contributors &amp;</span>\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">maintainers virtual meetup, bringing together the vibrant open source<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">community across all University of California campuses! Whether you’re a<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">seasoned maintainer with years of experience or just thinking about starting<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">your open source journey, this collaborative space is designed for learning,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">sharing, and connecting with fellow UC community members who are passionate<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">about open source software. We’ll exchange insights, discuss challenges and<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">successes, discover new projects, and build meaningful connections with peers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">from across the UC system. This is the first of three annual meetups where<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">we’ll celebrate the incredible open source work happening throughout our<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">universities and support each other in growing as contributors and<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">maintainers. All experience levels are welcome—from curious beginners to<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">project leads—as we believe the best learning happens when diverse<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">perspectives come together.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Meeting link and all details on our\r\n<a href=\"https://ucospo.net/events/#all-campus-virtual-meetup\" title=\"https://ucospo.net/events/#all-campus-virtual-meetup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucospo.net/events/%23all-campus-virtual-meetup&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464428926000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2gsy2cKAYl89wwJymagds7\">\r\nevents page</a>!<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Cheers,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Laura Langdon (she/her)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Community Manager @ <a href=\"https://ucospo.net/\" title=\"https://ucospo.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucospo.net/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464428927000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1syh9EjN9Wcjqu-qU8Anmy\">\r\nUC OSPO Network</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Book time with me! <a href=\"http://30%20mins\" title=\"30 mins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://30%2520mins&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464428927000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06yXcy7SB-XFISJ77SyR8b\">\r\n30 mins</a> or <a href=\"https://book.vimcal.com/p/lauralangdon/50-minute-meeting-5ryhp\" title=\"https://book.vimcal.com/p/lauralangdon/50-minute-meeting-5ryhp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://book.vimcal.com/p/lauralangdon/50-minute-meeting-5ryhp&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464428927000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ht_i1ElbrkXIjATrIyaCI\">\r\n50 mins</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Questions? Come have a <a href=\"https://ucospo.net/events/#virtual-coffeeoffice-hours-ongoing\" title=\"https://ucospo.net/events/#virtual-coffeeoffice-hours-ongoing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucospo.net/events/%23virtual-coffeeoffice-hours-ongoing&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464428927000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3O9HGAI9ZJNbnKsS1959fc\">\r\nvirtual coffee</a> with me </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">☕</span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
